OL,3,GNEWSAFirst time runner aims to beat
OL,4,Agrandad's time
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan said: "It was my turn, my grandad
OL,7,Fand my dad have run it before, I surf
OL,8,Fand I did run in school but not
OL,9,Fdistance, I started to train and I
OL,10,Freally didn't want to like running but
OL,11,FI love it."
